://api.github.com/users/akien-mga/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":5791,"closed_issues":0,"state":"open","created_at":"2022-07-26T12:42:05Z","updated_at":"2026-10-21T22:40:26Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":null},"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-08-03T16:18:00Z","updated_at":"2026-08-14T16:46:29Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"draft":false,"pull_request":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/122066","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122066","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122066.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122066.patch","merged_at":null},"body":"- **Depends on https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/122058.**\r\n\r\n___\r\n\r\n- Disable upper and lower fade, so that decals are always fully opaque regardless of the distance between the decal and surface. This is generally desired for hard surface decals, which should always appear at full opacity.\r\n- Set size to a non-cube size for better culling efficiency and usability. Since the shape of the decal is now a stretched box, it's now more obvious which way it's meant to be oriented.\r\n\r\nFor compatibility, this does not affect Decals created via code, or decals created in older versions of Godot.\r\n\r\nThis is based on discussions I've had with @passivestar on improving decal usability.\r\n\r\nA further improvement would be to add a default texture, so you can quickly see whether the decal is oriented the right way around without needing to find a placeholder yourself. This is pending on https://github.com/godotengine/godot-proposals/discussions/5294 being implemented (and would require a texture-based approach instead of a material-based approach).\r\n\r\n## Preview\r\n\r\n<img width=\"281\" height=\"224\" alt=\"image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c4875eb5-1342-4db2-a20f-ee348e692e0f\" />\r\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122066/reactions","total_count":10,"+1":5,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":2,"confused":0,"heart":3,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/122066/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null}